title: Talks with the Left-SRs
new-page: true
view-if: ca_election_held = 1 and coalition_government != 1
max-visits: 1
tags: event

Though opposed to coalition government in general, the recent election results have led Lenin and others to consider a more limited coalition with just the Left-SRs. Given that the SRs overall won the election, courting the sympathetic Left-SRs to our side would help divide the SR vote. 

Talks are already planned to discuss the merger of the peasants' soviets and the workers' and soldiers' Soviets into a single system, which could serve as an opportunity for further talks with the Left-SRs. 

  
- @initiate_talks
- @reject_talks

@reject_talks
title: We have no need for allies! 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.lsr_relation -= 15;
  Q.moderate_unrest += 5;
  Q.moderate_strength -= 2;
!}           

We shut down the proposed talks before they can begin. Needless to say, the Left-SRs are unenthused. 

@initiate_talks
title: Agree to talks with the Left-SRs. 
go-to: menu
on-arrival: {!
  Q.influence = (10 + (Q.lsr_relation / 2) + (Q.lsr_strength / 5) - (Q.instability / 10));
  Q.drop_foreign = 0; Q.drop_military = 0; Q.drop_enlightenment = 0; Q.drop_internal = 0; Q.drop_railways = 0; Q.drop_trade = 0; Q.drop_finance = 0; Q.drop_labor = 0; Q.drop_justice = 0; Q.drop_agriculture = 0; Q.drop_foodsupply = 0; Q.drop_posts = 0; Q.drop_nationalities = 0; Q.drop_welfare = 0; Q.drop_property = 0; Q.drop_local = 0; 
  Q.commissariats_held = 14; 
!}

We open talks with the Left-SRs, though various objections and protests drag the talks out for days. 

The Left-SRs have put forth their primary demands:

<ul>Control over the People's Commissariats for Internal Affairs, Military, Justice, Agriculture, and Railways (in that order).<br>
Rough parity in Sovnarkom, and positions within the collegia of people's commissariats and government institutions.<br>
A military build-up to protect the revolution, and support socialist uprisings abroad.<br>
Creation of a just system of revolutionary laws.<br>
Implementation of land reform in the countryside. </ul> 

Ceding so many commissariats is not something Lenin will allow, but the demands nonetheless serve as a good starting point. 


