@reject_offer
title: It seems we can't come to an agreement. 
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
  Q.lsr_relation -= 15;
  Q.moderate_unrest += 5; 
  Q.moderate_strength -= 2;
  Q.instability += 0.5; 
!}

= Negotiations Collapse

Unable to come to an agreement, we haven broken off talks with the Left-SRs. It remains to be seen if we will be able to govern without their involvement. 

  
@accept_offer
title: Agree to the offer. 
unavailable-subtitle: The Left-SRs will not accept the current offer. 
choose-if: influence > 56 and (drop_internal = 1 or drop_military = 1 or drop_justice = 1) and commissariats_held <= 8
new-page: true
on-arrival: commissariats_promised = commissariats_held; commissariats_held = 14;
go-to: cabinet_negotiations2

We have formed a tentative agreement. Now we must finalize the selections in the people's commissariats. 

@cabinet_negotiations2
title: Cabinet negotiations
on-arrival: {!
  console.log("commissariats_promised: ", Q.commissariats_promised);
  console.log("commissariats_held: ", Q.commissariats_held);
!}

- #commissariat_assign2
- @finalize_deal
- @cancel_deal

@cancel_deal
title: On second thought, a deal is impossible. 
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
  Q.lsr_relation -= 15;
  Q.right_sr_strength += 2; Q.right_m_strength += 2;   
  Q.instability += 0.5; 
  Q.moderate_dissent += 5; Q.moderate_strength -= 2;
  if (Q.foreign_minister_party != "Bolshevik") {
    Q.foreign_minister = "Vacant";
    Q.foreign_minister_party = "Bolshevik";
  }
 if (Q.interior_minister_party != "Bolshevik") {
